## 7. RULES FOR OTHER AI

1. **Always** run KHUB intro before UI (with SKIP).
2. **Always** use Rexx loader: `carbonpanel.../script=48`.
3. Window **Title** = game name (`KHUB · GameName`).
4. Create **all tabs first**, then fill with `do ... end`.
5. Use **Flag** on every Toggle / Slider / Dropdown.
6. Use **uiNotify** for feedback.
7. Default toggle key: **RightShift**.
8. Branding: **Kyiel Pambid / KHUB** only — no other hub names.
9. Discord: `https://discord.gg/CTqBhzTGHV`
10. YouTube: `https://www.youtube.com/@kyielpambid`

